ng>【<i>Multiplayer Support</i>】Life in another world can get lonely alone—but what about four people? </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game supports up to four players online, with both PvE and PvP! Not that I’d ever tell you that you can summon your friends into the world of <i>Alchemage</i> together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/691390/extras/225ffd9cfb6f13beb99a727933297dec.poster.avif?t=1788147770\" width=1000 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/691390/extras/225ffd9cfb6f13beb99a727933297dec.webm?t=1788147770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/691390/extras/225ffd9cfb6f13beb99a727933297dec.mp4?t=1788147770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Finally, welcome to <i>Alchemage</i>!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlucky Alchemist, kick off your adventure! Along the way, rare materials, spooky creatures, and powerful alchemy magic are all waiting for you to discover and collect. We believe you have what it takes to unravel the mysteries hidden deep within this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/691390/extras/b3cac3b5ae7c87be6257d6d42d0afbea.poster.avif?t=1788147770\" width=1000 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/691390/extras/b3cac3b5ae7c87be6257d6d42d0afbea.webm?t=1788147770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/691390/extras/b3cac3b5ae7c87be6257d6d42d0afbea.mp4?t=1788147770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
